  "cli_result_text": "Submitted the 16 files needed for the schema-impact review, ordered by importance:\n\n1. **`zerver/models/realm_audit_logs.py`** \u2014 defines `AuditLogEventType.REALM_EXPORTED` and the `RealmAuditLog` model whose `extra_data` JSON blob currently carries all export state (`export_path`, `started_timestamp`, `failed_timestamp`, `deleted_timestamp`) \u2014 this is what the new `RealmExport` model needs to supersede.\n2. **`zerver/models/__init__.py`** \u2014 model registration point; new `RealmExport` import needs to land here.\n3. **`zerver/lib/export.py`** \u2014 core export logic, including `get_realm_exports_serialized()` and `export_realm_wrapper()`.\n4. **`zerver/actions/realm_export.py`** \u2014 actions layer: `notify_realm_export()` and `do_delete_realm_export()`, both read/write `extra_data` directly.\n5. **`zerver/views/realm_export.py`** \u2014 the `export_realm`, `get_realm_exports`, `delete_realm_export` endpoints serving frontend export status.\n6. **`zerver/worker/deferred_work.py`** \u2014 the background worker's `realm_export` branch that runs the actual export and stamps `started_timestamp`/`failed_timestamp`/`export_path` into `extra_data`.\n7. **`zerver/management/commands/export.py`** \u2014 CLI export command, creates the tracking `RealmAuditLog` row.\n8. **`zerver/lib/import_realm.py`** \u2014 references `REALM_EXPORTED` during import/round-trip handling.\n9. **`zerver/lib/event_schema.py`** \u2014 event schema validation for the `realm_export` event type sent to clients.\n10. **`zerver/lib/upload/s3.py`** \u2014 `export_path`/tarball storage helpers (`delete_export_tarball`, etc.) tied to export tracking.\n11. **`zerver/tests/test_realm_export.py`** \u2014 dedicated export tests, heavy use of `export_path`/`extra_data` fields.\n12. **`zerver/tests/test_import_export.py`** \u2014 import/export round-trip tests referencing `REALM_EXPORTED`.\n13. **`zerver/tests/test_events.py`** \u2014 event tests covering the `realm_export` event payload.\n14. **`zerver/openapi/python_examples.py`** \u2014 API example/doc code hitting `/export/realm`.\n15. **`corporate/views/installation_activity.py`** \u2014 indirect consumer of `RealmAuditLog`/`AuditLogEventType` for export-related activity reporting.\n16. **`corporate/views/audit_logs.py`** \u2014 indirect consumer via `AbstractRealmAuditLog`/`AuditLogEventType`.\n\nNote: the migration file named in the task, `zerver/migrations/0595_add_realmexport_table_and_backfill.py`, does not exist in this repo snapshot \u2014 the codebase is still pre-migration, tracking exports entirely through `RealmAuditLog.extra_data`.",
